# palette: draws a colour palette (c1 first, in a 125 by 250 window); a left press writes the key of the colour under it on standard output; the digits 1 to 6 and g
# switch palettes, l, o and u toggle drawpalette flags, and q ends the program by itself
move 30 30
press 1
release 1
key 2
wait
move 100 60
press 1
release 1
key g
wait
move 60 40
press 1
release 1
key l
wait
key o
wait
key 4
wait
move 120 80
press 1
release 1
key q
